ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.virusmyth.net/aids/reappraising">http://www.virusmyth.net/aids/reappraising</ext-link>. Accessed 14 November 2006</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040256-b008"><citation citation-type="other"><collab>National Institute of Allergy and Infectious Diseases</collab><year>2003</year><article-title>The evidence that HIV causes AIDS</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.niaid.nih.gov/factsheets/evidhiv.htm">http://www.niaid.nih.gov/factsheets/evidhiv.htm</ext-link>. Accessed 17 July 2007</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040256-b009"><citation citation-type="other"><collab>AIDS Truth</collab><year>2007</year><article-title>Debunking AIDS denialist myths</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.aidstruth.org/debunking-denialist-myths.php">http://www.aidstruth.org/debunking-denialist-myths.php</ext-link>. Accessed 17 July 2007</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040256-b010"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group><name><surname>Maggiore</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><year>1997</year><source>What if everything you thought you knew about AIDS was wrong?</source><publisher-loc>Studio City (CA)</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Health Education AIDS Liaison</publisher-name><page-count count="126"/></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040256-b011"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group><name><surname>Gerhard</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>HIV-positive women birthing outside the system</article-title><comment>Mothering Magazine. Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.healtoronto.com/mothering1001a.html">http://www.healtoronto.com/mothering1001a.html</ext-link>. Accessed 17 July 2007</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040256-b012"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group><name><surname>Ribe</surna