-name>Melville House</publisher-name><page-count count="345"/></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040256-b017"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group><name><surname>Culshaw</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Why I quit HIV</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.lewrockwell.com/orig7/culshaw1.html">http://www.lewrockwell.com/orig7/culshaw1.html</ext-link>. Accessed 17 July 2007</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040256-b018"><citation citation-type="book"><person-group><name><surname>Al-Bayati</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><year>1999</year><source>Get all the facts: HIV does not cause AIDS</source><publisher-loc>Dixon (CA)</publisher-loc><publisher-name>Toxi-Health International</publisher-name><page-count count="200"/></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040256-b019"><citation citation-type="other"><collab>Dr. Rath Health Foundation</collab><year>2005</year><article-title>The end of the AIDS epidemic is in sight&#x00021;</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www4.dr-rath-foundation.org/THE_FOUNDATION/press_release20050615.htm">http://www4.dr-rath-foundation.org/THE_FOUNDATION/press_release20050615.htm</ext-link>. Accessed 17 July 2007</comment></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040256-b020"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group><name><surname>Watson</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>Scientists, activists sue South Africa's AIDS &#x02018;denialists&#x02019;</article-title><source>Nat Med</source><volume>12</volume><fpage>6</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16397537</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pmed-0040256-b021"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group><name><surname>Wright</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>The contradictions and paradoxes of AIDS orthodoxy<